at only require a few steps, it is better to just complete the objective directly and NOT use this tool.\nWriting todos takes time and tokens, use it when it is helpful for managing complex many-step problems! But not for simple few-step requests.\n\n## Important To-Do List Usage Notes to Remember\n- The `write_todos` tool should never be called multiple times in parallel.\n- Don't be afraid to revise the To-Do list as you go. New information may reveal new tasks that need to be done, or old tasks that are irrelevant."}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}), HumanMessage(content='tell me what classes to take in 8 semesters as an ee major. i want to be an FPGA engineer at a HFT firm', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='6e5a3997-8e07-45d3-87ca-b96b3a8f9fe2'), AIMessage(content=[{'id': 'toolu_01QEehPsf8c6p8No8UrgsUUw', 'input': {}, 'name': 'get_user_profile', 'type': 'tool_use', 'index': 0, 'partial_json': ''}, {'id': 'toolu_01EPsprkHTCfLKvnEC6QeTud', 'input': {}, 'name': 'lookup_major', 'type': 'tool_use', 'index': 1, 'partial_json': '{"major": "electrical engineering"}'}, {'id': 'toolu_01LNYHkspFNRKAeMAtWYpm1e', 'input': {}, 'name': 'lookup_school_wide_requirements', 'type': 'tool_use', 'index': 2, 'partial_json': '{"input": {"query":"nontechnical_requirements"}}'}, {'id': 'toolu_013k4uoY3JddS6cU97qZwqR3', 'input': {}, 'name': 'lookup_school_wide_requirements', 'type': 'tool_use', 'index': 3, 'partial_json': '{"input": {"query":"technical_requirements"}}'}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_name': 'claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929', 'model_provider': 'anthropic', 'stop_reason': 'tool_use', 'stop_sequence': None}, id='lc_run--019b9093-c368-7a71-80ef-25cebc022f84', tool_calls=[{'name': 'get_user_profile', 'args': {}, 'id': 'toolu_01QEehPsf8c6p8No8UrgsUUw', 'type': 'tool_call'}, {'name': 'lookup_major', 'args': {'major': 'electrical engineering'}, 'id': 'toolu_01EPsprkHTCfLKvnEC6QeTud', 'type': 'tool_call'}, {'name': 'lookup_school_wide_req