es that are particularly relevant for an FPGA engineer at an HFT (High-Frequency Trading) firm:', 'type': 'text', 'index': 0}, {'id': 'toolu_01HtkJSS6qwH1H4JnY3GHkeB', 'input': {}, 'name': 'search_courses', 'type': 'tool_use', 'index': 1, 'partial_json': '{"input": {"query":"FPGA digital design hardware","limit":10}}'}, {'id': 'toolu_01NvK2V6C5BicRkPURSVqVKj', 'input': {}, 'name': 'search_courses', 'type': 'tool_use', 'index': 2, 'partial_json': '{"input": {"query":"VHDL Verilog hardware description language","limit":10}}'}, {'id': 'toolu_017F3sbvzDamdNj65f6D8WUC', 'input': {}, 'name': 'search_courses', 'type': 'tool_use', 'index': 3, 'partial_json': '{"input": {"query":"computer architecture hardware systems","limit":10}}'}, {'id': 'toolu_01CyLVgygtsCe1T8D8b3LZpZ', 'input': {}, 'name': 'search_courses', 'type': 'tool_use', 'index': 4, 'partial_json': '{"input": {"query":"high performance computing parallel processing","limit":10}}'}, {'id': 'toolu_01HE6nFTu5eSdwpYhGCMc6fr', 'input': {}, 'name': 'search_courses', 'type': 'tool_use', 'index': 5, 'partial_json': '{"input": {"query":"algorithms data structures optimization","limit":10}}'}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_name': 'claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929', 'model_provider': 'anthropic', 'stop_reason': 'tool_use', 'stop_sequence': None}, id='lc_run--019b9093-d229-7831-baff-6dc0aac3046e', tool_calls=[{'name': 'search_courses', 'args': {'input': {'query': 'FPGA digital design hardware', 'limit': 10}}, 'id': 'toolu_01HtkJSS6qwH1H4JnY3GHkeB', 'type': 'tool_call'}, {'name': 'search_courses', 'args': {'input': {'query': 'VHDL Verilog hardware description language', 'limit': 10}}, 'id': 'toolu_01NvK2V6C5BicRkPURSVqVKj', 'type': 'tool_call'}, {'name': 'search_courses', 'args': {'input': {'query': 'computer architecture hardware systems', 'limit': 10}}, 'id': 'toolu_017F3sbvzDamdNj65f6D8WUC', 'type': 'tool_call'}, {'name': 'search_courses', 'args': {'input': {'query': 'high performance computing parallel proces