 "department_code": "BUSI", "points": "3", "instructor": "Len Sherman", "scheduled_time_start": 625, "scheduled_time_end": 775, "scheduled_days": "R", "type": "LECTURE", "content": "STRATEGY FORMULATION (BUSI UN3701)\\n        Course Subtitle: \\n        Description: This class is an introduction to strategic management and the decisions that firms make in their historical context. We look at the growth of the large multi-product firm in almost all countries in the world and the the process by which they internationalized their activities and, very often, were also forced to retreat from their international positions. \xa0We treat strategies as relation to two broad goals of the c...", "similarity_score": 1.4045660495758057}, {"course_title": "ENTREPRENEURSHIP: DEVELOP/IMPLEMENT NEW", "course_code": "BUSI PS5030", "department": "School of Professional Studies (DVSP)", "department_code": "BUSI", "points": "3", "instructor": "Michael E Jr McGuire", "scheduled_time_start": 370, "scheduled_time_end": 480, "scheduled_days": "R", "type": "LECTURE", "content": "ENTREPRENEURSHIP: DEVELOP/IMPLEMENT NEW (BUSI PS5030)\\n        Course Subtitle: ENTREPRENEURSHIP\\n        Description: This course is designed for students interested in entrepreneurship and becoming CEO/Founders or leaders in industry as innovators and operators. The class is appropriate for those with a strong interest in new ventures or innovation at the corporate level, or for those who want to develop an entrepreneurial mindset even if you have no plans to start a business. This includes pote...", "similarity_score": 1.414426565170288}], "total_count": 8}', name='search_courses', id='331f9bc5-7518-4e97-83c9-cd0bb9ff773d', tool_call_id='toolu_01R3kPKVAqejQPTepFpGVeGi'), AIMessage(content=[{'text': 'Let me look up a few more critical courses:', 'type': 'text', 'index': 0}, {'id': 'toolu_01CH38UKtDGw3VrAs7m1YLPZ', 'input': {}, 'name': 'lookup_course', 'type': 'tool_use', 'index': 1, 'partial_json': '{"course_cod