ontent\n\n3. **Other (6 points):** Any additional technical courses\n\n---\n\n## **Nontechnical Requirements** (27 points)\n\n### **Required (16-18 points):**\n- **University Writing:** ENGL CC1010\n- **Core Humanities:** Choose one sequence:\n  - Literature Humanities (HUMA CC1001, CC1002) OR\n  - Contemporary Civilization (COCI CC1101, CC1102) OR\n  - Two approved Global Core courses\n- **Art or Music:** HUMA UN1121 or UN1123\n- **Economics:** ECON UN1105\n\n### **Electives (9-11 points):**\n- Choose from SEAS-approved nontechnical elective list (List B)\n\n---\n\n## **Other Requirements**\n- **Art of Engineering:** ENGI E1102\n- **Physical Education:** PHED UN1001, UN1002\n\n---\n\n## **Important Notes:**\n- **ELEN E1201** can be taken as early as first year (typically spring semester)\n- If you replace APMA E2101 with MATH UN2030 + Linear Algebra, technical electives reduce from 18 to 15 points\n- Transfer students without ELEN E1201 equivalent cannot choose circuits & electronics as their depth area\n\nWould you like help planning your specific course schedule or have questions about any of these requirements?", 'type': 'text', 'index': 0}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_name': 'claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929', 'model_provider': 'anthropic', 'stop_reason': 'end_turn', 'stop_sequence': None}, id='lc_run--019b90a5-468f-7493-8f18-9648d11e202a', usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 3927, 'output_tokens': 970, 'total_tokens': 4897, 'input_token_details': {'cache_creation': 0, 'cache_read': 0}})]}, 'input': {'messages': [HumanMessage(content='tell me ee requirements', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='23afd3f8-7155-4b00-bac6-21019dc7ece7'), AIMessage(content=[{'id': 'toolu_0195nkfcLMwdcp8e8sRufTe3', 'input': {}, 'name': 'lookup_major', 'type': 'tool_use', 'index': 0, 'partial_json': '{"major": "electrical engineering"}'}], additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_name': 'claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929', 'model_provider': 'anthropic', 'stop_r