{'event': 'on_chat_model_end', 'data': {'output': AIMessage(content=[{'text': "Great! Here's an overview of the **Electrical Engineering (EE) requirements** for a BS degree at Columbia:\n\n## **Total Credits: 128 points**\n\n### **Core EE Courses**\n- **ELEN E1201** - Intro to Electrical Engineering\n- **ELEN E3201** - Analog Electronic Circuits\n- **ELEN E3331** - Electronic Circuits\n- **ELEN E3801** - Signals and Systems\n- **ELEN E3401** - Electromagnetics\n- **Communications/Networking** (choose one): ELEN E3701 or CSEE W4119\n- **CSEE W3827** - Computer Systems\n- **ELEN E3399** - Professional Practice\n- **ELEN E3390** - Senior Design\n\n### **Labs (5 required)**\n- ELEN E3081, E3082, E3083, E3084, E3043\n- Take labs with corresponding lecture courses when possible\n\n### **Math & Science Requirements**\n- **Calculus**: MATH UN1101, UN1102\n- **Multivariable**: APMA E2000, E2001\n- **Differential Equations**: APMA E2101 (or alternatives)\n- **Probability** (choose one): IEOR E3658 or STAT GU4203\n- **Physics sequence** (choose one of three sequences)\n- **Physics Lab**: PHYS UN1494\n- **Chemistry** (choose one): CHEM UN1403/1404/2045/1604\n- **Computer Science - Data Structures** (choose one): COMS W3134/3136/3137\n\n### **Technical Electives: 18 points total**\n- **6 points**: Depth area (one specialized EE area)\n- **6 points**: Breadth (outside your depth area)\n- **6 points**: Any additional technical courses\n\n**Depth areas**: Photonics/solid-state devices/electromagnetics, Circuits/electronics, Signals/systems, or Communications/networking\n\n### **Nontechnical: 27 points**\n- University Writing\n- Core Humanities sequences\n- Art or Music Humanities\n- Economics (ECON UN1105)\n- 9-11 points of nontechnical electives\n\n### **Other**\n- **ENGI E1102** - Art of Engineering\n- **2 PE courses**: PHED UN1001, UN1002\n\nWould you like help planning out your specific course schedule or have questions about any particular requirements?", 'type': 'text', 'inde